{"id":"00059","root":"uni00059_1","name":{"ja":"メロード・クロア","en":"Merode Croix"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"メロード・クロア","en":"Merode Croix"},"aliases":["Melody Croix"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-10-05","limited":false,"characterId":52,"profile":{"ja":"魔界で名の通った芸術家。作品は芸術性の評価も高いが、『魔創画』と呼ばれる描かれた物を実体化させる絵画は特にその価値が高いと言われている。その為に魔界の有力者や貴族の中にはステータスとその資産価値からお抱え絵師として囲い込もうとする者が多くいる。だが、本人は根っからの芸術家肌で、金で雇われることをよしとしないために、未だに誰のお抱えにもなっていない。中には力ずくでと考える者もいたが、彼女自身の能力によって撃退されている。ただ、性格は気難しくはなく意外と飄々としたタイプで、アトリエを空けて旅に出たり、請われて指導をする事もある。新しい表現に常に飢えていて、人間界の印刷や映像技術に並々ならない関心を抱き、頻繁に人間界に顔を出している。","en":"Merode Croix is a renowned artist in the Demon Realm. Her works are highly praised for their artistic merit, but her paintings that materialize what they depict—known as \"Maso-ga\"—are especially valuable. Because of this, many powerful figures and nobles in the Demon Realm seek to claim her as a personal artist for status and wealth. However, she is a true artist at heart and refuses to be hired for money, so she remains unaffiliated. Some have considered forcing her, but she repels such attempts with her own abilities. Her personality isn't difficult; she's surprisingly easy-going, sometimes leaving her atelier to travel or taking commissions to teach. She constantly craves new forms of expression and holds a keen interest in Human Realm printing and visual technologies, frequently making appearances there."},"illustrator":"ＺＯＬ","voiceActor":"佐倉もも花","forms":[{"id":"uni00059_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[734,1468],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[98,196],"def":[115,230],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","20003"]},{"id":"uni00059_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1068,2136],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[146,292],"def":[180,360],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","20003","20004"]},{"id":"uni00059_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats"