"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"「メロード・クロアだ、こう見えて芸術家としては魔界でそれなりに名が通っているんだよ」","en":"I'm Merode Croix—looks like this, but I'm pretty well-known as an artist in the Demon Realm."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00059_1/uni00059_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"君の理想を教えてくれたまえ。私はそれを描き上げてみせよう","en":"Tell me your ideal, and I'll paint it for you."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00059_1/uni00059_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"すまない、少し集中させてくれ、折角のインスピレーションを無駄にしたくない","en":"Sorry, give me a moment to focus; I don't want to waste this precious inspiration."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00059_1/uni00059_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"おや、君はこの作品が好きなのかい？　ふふふ、良いセンスをしているよ","en":"Oh, do you like this piece? Hehe, you've got good taste."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00059_1/uni00059_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"人間の作る芸術もそそるが、それ以上に印刷や映像技術は面白い、実に興味が尽きないね！","en":"Human-made art is intriguing, but printing and video tech are even more fascinating—I'm endlessly interested!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00059_1/uni00059_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"丁度いいところに、すまないがデッサンモデルになってくれないか？　ああ、もちろんヌードモデルさ","en":"Right on time. Sorry, could you pose as a sketch model? Ah, of course, a nude model."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00059_1/uni00059_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"芸術家等と言って私を持ち上げるだけで、芸術を解さない者が多くて困るね","en":"People call me an artist and lift me up, but there are so many who don't understand art—that's a problem."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00059_1/uni00059_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"魔創画と言ってね。私の描いた物は実体化するんだ。ふふ、興味があるのかい？","en":"It's called a Maso-ga. 